# The frozen copies of real scores are not committed: they are somebody's music, and they
# weigh megabytes. A song with no score simply skips its snapshot tests.
#
# Written as scores/* rather than scores/, so that the exceptions below can apply: git
# cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is itself excluded.
scores/*

# The synthetic ones are ours and tiny, so they are the fixtures of record and travel with
# the repository, which is what lets CI run their suites. test/its/synthetic.test.js keeps
# each of them in step with the generator that produces it.
!scores/test_le_MultiVerso.mscz
!scores/test_le_MalaguenaMini.mscz
